flowchart LR
    %% resolving crystalline://domain/permalink
    url["crystalline://jordi/projects/x"] --> split[Split scheme, domain, permalink]
    split --> dom{Domain registered?}
    dom -- no --> miss[Not found: name the bare permalink]
    dom -- yes --> alias{Alias for an older permalink?}
    alias -- yes --> follow[Follow alias.rs]
    alias -- no --> lookup[Look up the permalink]
    follow --> lookup
    lookup --> engram[(Engram row)]
